WEBVTT

00:01:59.417 --> 00:02:00.684
CH: Thank you.

00:02:00.708 --> 00:02:03.476
CA: And yes, if you know anyone out there

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:09.726
who has just got stuck on,
"But how do people get back to work?"

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:12.601
"Where do we go from here?"

00:02:12.625 --> 00:02:14.351
Those are the people who you should,

00:02:14.375 --> 00:02:16.809
maybe invite them
into this conversation right now,

00:02:16.833 --> 00:02:19.643
because I think they're going to be
really interested.

00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:22.601
Our speaker, our guest

00:02:22.625 --> 00:02:25.976
is a professor at Harvard, Danielle Allen.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.809
She runs, among other things,

00:02:28.833 --> 00:02:32.934
she runs an institute for ethics there,
the Safra institute.